U_flow" fillcolor="#e1bee7" shape=folder]
	}
	subgraph cluster_mpc {
		color=blue label="MPC Controller
(Algorithm 1: FlowMPPI / Algorithm 2: FlowiCEM)" style=rounded
		Nominal [label="Previous Nominal U
or Mean μ" shape=box]
